equirement, caste/category criteria, and education level</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-green-600 text-white text-xs font-black w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1\">Gather Documents</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Collect income certificate, marksheets, Aadhaar, admission proof, and bank details</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-purple-600 text-white text-xs font-black w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1\">Apply Online</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Register on NSP (scholarships.gov.in) for government schemes or company websites for private</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"bg-orange-500 text-white text-xs font-black w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">04</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1\">Track &amp; Renew</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Check application status regularly, renew before deadline each year with updated documents</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5\">Important Scholarship Portals</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"border rounded-xl p-4 border-green-200 bg-green-50\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/70 text-green-700\">Government</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4 text-green-700 opacity-60\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.